{#
integration/_destination.html.twig — choose where a saved attachment lands.

The other face of the file picker (integration/_picker.html.twig): that one
pulls a file INTO a draft, this one picks the folder or album a message's
attachment is saved OUT to. Both load into the one modal shell and share its
chrome, so the difference a user sees is only what fills the middle.

Two shapes, decided by the taxonomy rather than by provider name:

  A file store (Nextcloud, Drive, …) gets a folder tree. Folders navigate, the
  breadcrumb walks back up, and one "Save here" button in the footer targets
  wherever the user has browsed to — the root included.

  A photo library (Immich, Google Photos) gets its albums, flat: there is no
  tree to descend, so each album is itself the button, and a "Library" row
  saves with no album at all.

And two MODES, decided by whether there is a part:

  With a part, a choice is a save: the row or the footer posts the upload and
  the dialog closes on it.

  Without one — the filter editor picking the folder a rule will save to — there
  is nothing to upload, so a choice is reported back instead. The controls stop
  being forms and become buttons that hand the folder id and a readable label to
  integration--destination-picker, which dispatches them at the document and
  closes the dialog. Navigation, the breadcrumb and the listing are identical;
  only what a choice DOES differs, which is the point — the rule editor offers
  the same chooser rather than a second, thinner one.

"New folder" / "New album" re-renders this frame sitting in the new container,
and carries data-ui--modal-keep-open so that re-render does not read as a
finished save and close the dialog. The save forms deliberately do NOT carry it:
a successful save is exactly when the modal should close.
#}
{% extends '_layout/app.html.twig' %}

{% set isMediaLibrary = integration.provider.isMediaLibrary %}

{# Pick mode is the absence of something to upload, not a separate flag — see
   FilePickerController::renderDestination(). #}
{% set isPick = part is null %}

{# Every link back into this chooser carries the mode and, where there is one,
   the part. Built once so a navigation cannot quietly drop half of it and land
   the user in the attach picker instead. #}
{% set browseArgs = isPick
    ? { id: integration.id, mode: 'destination' }
    : { id: integration.id, mode: 'destination', part: part.id } %}

{#
One row that offers a container as a choice: an album in a photo library, or
the library itself.

Both modes draw the same row; only its wrapper differs. In save mode it is a
form that uploads, in pick mode a button that reports the choice back. The
inner markup is captured once rather than written twice, so the two cannot
drift into looking like different features.
#}
{% macro chooseRow(integration, part, isPick, destination, name, icon) %}
    {% set inner %}
        <span class="w-9 h-9 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-raised">
            <i class="fa-solid {{ icon }} text-sm text-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </span>
        <span class="flex-1 min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-ink">{{ name }}</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-medium text-accent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100
                     group-focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
            {{ (isPick ? 'integration.destination.choose_this' : 'integration.destination.save_here')|trans }}
        </span>
    {% endset %}
    {% set rowClass = 'group w-full flex items-center gap-3 -mx-2 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl
                       hover:bg-hover transition-colors text-left
                       focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent' %}
    <li>
        {% if isPick %}
            <button type="button" class="{{ rowClass }}"
                    data-action="click->integration--destination-picker#choose"
                    data-destination-folder="{{ destination }}"
                    data-destination-label="{{ name }}">
                {{ inner }}
            </button>
        {% else %}
            <form method="post" data-turbo-stream
                  action="{{ path('app_integration_save_attachment', { id: integration.id, part: part.id }) }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('integration-save-' ~ part.id) }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="destination" value="{{ destination }}">
                <button type="submit" class="{{ rowClass }}">{{ inner }}</button>
            </form>
        {% endif %}
    </li>
{% endmacro %}

{% import _self as dest %}

{% block body %}
    <turbo-frame id="modal">
        <template data-ui--modal-frame-title>{{ integration.name }}</template>

        <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col"
             {% if isPick %}data-controller="integration--destination-picker"{% endif %}>

            {# ── What this does ── #}
            <p class="px-6 pt-1 pb-3 shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">
                {% if isPick %}
                    {# No file to name, because there is no file yet — this is
                       the folder a rule will use for whatever arrives. #}
                    {{ 'integration.destination.choose_for_filter'|trans }}
                {% else %}
                    {{ (isMediaLibrary
                        ? 'integration.destination.choose_album'
                        : 'integration.destination.choose_folder')|trans({ '%file%': part.filename ?: 'attachment' }) }}
                {% endif %}
            </p>

            {% if createError is not null %}
                <div role="alert" class="mx-6 mb-3 flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg alert-danger px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-danger">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <p class="leading-snug">{{ createError }}</p>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if error is not null %}

                <div role="alert" class="m-5 flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg alert-danger px-3.5 py-3 text-sm text-danger">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <p class="leading-snug">{{ error }}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="px-6 pb-3 shrink-0">
                    <a href="{{ path('app_integration_browse', browseArgs) }}"
                       class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 h-8 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                              text-ink-soft bg-field border border-field hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        {{ 'integration.destination.start_over'|trans }}
                    </a>
                </div>

            {% else %}

                {# ── Breadcrumb — a folder tree only ── #}
                {% if not isMediaLibrary %}
                    <nav class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap px-6 pb-3 shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-muted">
                        {% for crumb in listing.breadcrumb %}
                            {% if not loop.last %}
                                <a href="{{ path('app_integration_browse', browseArgs|merge({ folder: crumb.id })) }}"
                                   class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">{{ crumb.name }}</a>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-[8px] text-ink-faint" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            {% else %}
                                <span class="text-ink font-medium">{{ crumb.name }}</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        {% endfor %}
                    </nav>
                {% endif %}

                {# ── The containers ── #}
                <div class="flex-1 min-h-[14rem] min-w-0 px-6 overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain">
                    <div class="py-2">
                        {% if isMediaLibrary %}

                            <ul class="space-y-0.5">
                                {# Always available: the library itself, no album. #}
                                {{ dest.chooseRow(integration, part, isPick, '', 'integration.destination.library'|trans, 'fa-photo-film') }}
                                {% for entry in listing.folders %}
                                    {{ dest.chooseRow(integration, part, isPick, entry.id, entry.name, 'fa-images') }}
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                            {% if listing.folders is empty %}
                                <p class="py-6 text-center text-sm text-ink-faint italic">
                                    {{ 'integration.destination.no_albums'|trans }}
                                </p>
                            {% endif %}

                        {% else %}

                            {% if listing.folders is empty %}
                                <p class="py-6 text-center text-sm text-ink-faint italic">
                                    {{ 'integration.destination.no_subfolders'|trans }}
                                </p>
                            {% else %}
                                <ul class="space-y-0.5">
                                    {% for entry in listing.folders %}
                                        {% include 'integration/_folder_row.html.twig' with {
                                            integration: integration,
                                            entry: entry,
                                            draftId: 0,
                                            mode: 'destination',
                                            part: isPick ? null : part.id,
                                        } only %}
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </ul>
                            {% endif %}

                            {# Files in this folder, shown for context but not
                               targetable — you save into a folder, not onto a
                               file. Muted so the folders read as the choices. #}
                            {% if listing.files is not empty %}
                                <ul class="mt-1 space-y-0.5">
                                    {% for entry in listing.files %}
                                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 -mx-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl opacity-40">
                                            <span class="w-9 h-9 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-raised">
                                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file text-sm text-ink-faint" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="flex-1 min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-ink-muted">{{ entry.name }}</span>
                                        </li>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </ul>
                            {% endif %}

                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>

                {# ── New folder / new album ──
                   Deliberately absent in pick mode. Creating a container is
                   keyed to a part at both ends — app_integration_create_destination
                   takes one in its path and its CSRF token is minted per part —
                   so offering it here would mean a second route and a second
                   token name for an affordance the manual save path already has.
                   A rule picks from folders that exist; the one it wants can be
                   made in the service, or by saving one attachment there by
                   hand, and then it is here. #}
                {% if canCreate and not isPick %}
                    <div class="px-6 pt-2 shrink-0">
                        <details class="group">
                            <summary class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 h-8 px-2.5 rounded-lg cursor-pointer
                                            text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft hover:bg-hover transition-colors
                                            focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                {{ (isMediaLibrary
                                    ? 'integration.destination.new_album'
                                    : 'integration.destination.new_folder')|trans }}
                            </summary>
                            <form method="post" data-ui--modal-keep-open
                                  action="{{ path('app_integration_create_destination', { id: integration.id, part: part.id }) }}"
                                  class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('integration-destination-' ~ part.id) }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="parent" value="{{ folderId }}">
                                <label class="sr-only" for="new-destination-name">
                                    {{ (isMediaLibrary
                                        ? 'integration.destination.album_name'
                                        : 'integration.destination.folder_name')|trans }}
                                </label>
                                <input type="text" id="new-destination-name" name="name" required
                                       placeholder="{{ (isMediaLibrary
                                            ? 'integration.destination.album_name'
                                            : 'integration.destination.folder_name')|trans }}"
                                       class="flex-1 min-w-0 h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                              focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                                <button type="submit"
                                        class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                                               text-ink-soft bg-field border border-field hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
                                    {{ 'integration.destination.create'|trans }}
                                </button>
                            </form>
                        </details>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}

            {% endif %}

            {# ── Footer ── #}
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-6 pb-5 pt-3 shrink-0">
                <div class="flex-1"></div>

                <button type="button" data-action="click->ui--modal#close"
                        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                               text-ink-soft bg-field border border-field hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
                    {{ 'form.cancel'|trans }}
                </button>

                {# A folder tree saves to wherever the user browsed to; an album
                   list saves per row, so there is nothing to save from here.
                   Offered even when the listing failed: the top level is always
                   a valid target, so a user is never left unable to save at all
                   because a subfolder would not load. #}
                {% if not isMediaLibrary %}
                    {# The readable half of the answer. Folder ids are opaque for
                       most services — a Drive id is a random string — so the
                       trail the driver built is what a person is shown once the
                       dialog is gone. The first crumb is the connection itself
                       and is dropped: the editor already names it. Empty when
                       the listing failed, which is also when the only reachable
                       choice is the root, and the root needs no label. #}
                    {% set hereLabel = listing is null
                        ? ''
                        : listing.breadcrumb|slice(1)|map(crumb => crumb.name)|join(' / ') %}
                    {% if isPick %}
                        <button type="button"
                                data-action="click->integration--destination-picker#choose"
                                data-destination-folder="{{ folderId }}"
                                data-destination-label="{{ hereLabel }}"
                                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                                       text-accent-ink bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong transition-colors">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            {{ 'integration.destination.choose_here'|trans }}
                        </button>
                    {% else %}
                        <form method="post" data-turbo-stream
                              action="{{ path('app_integration_save_attachment', { id: integration.id, part: part.id }) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('integration-save-' ~ part.id) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="destination" value="{{ folderId }}">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                                           text-accent-ink bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong transition-colors">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                {{ 'integration.destination.save_here'|trans }}
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endif %}
            </div>

        </div>
    </turbo-frame>
{% endblock %}
